  "comments": "<p>Silver fern or silver tree-fern or ponga tree (<i>Cyathea dealbata</i>) is endemic to New Zealand.<br><br><i>Obverse die varieties:</i><br><strong>KM#31.1</strong> <i>(1967-85)</i> Rounded high relief portrait;<br><strong>KM#31.2</strong> <i>(1984-85)</i> Die recut, low relief portrait;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Differences between circulation and BU/Proof issues</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/667c126a65d84.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/667c126a65d84.jpg\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/667c129172ad9.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/667c129172ad9.jpg\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/667c12a1af46c.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/667c12a1af46c.jpg\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6679886f3db89.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6679886f3db89.jpg\"></a><br><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/667c12cbd3828.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/667c12cbd3828.jpg\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>1980 obverse die varieties:</i><br><strong>Business strike for circulation</strong> ovoid 0 in date;<br><strong>BU &amp; Proof strike for set issue</strong> round O in date;<br>&nbsp;</p>",
